  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Refractive Error and Assistive Technology Community P (REACH)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribute to the effective scaling up of screening, refractive services and eyeglass provision and strengthen the integration of these approaches into government-led national programs. This will be achieved through two broader objectives namely: Expand access to affordable high-quality screening, refractive services, and eyeglasses provision that are responsive to population needs and secondly, Create a favorable environment for sustainable long-term AT investments and scale-up.</narrative>
  </description>
